# Mothball Mile: The Boneyard, track 1 (SPEC 19.5). A fast loop down the
# airliner rows on the old runway, under the wings (their shadows across
# the concrete), past an engine the AIs forgot to shut down (jet blast
# across the east taxiway) and a loose cowling rolling over the south
# runway, then through the infield kink by the tail fins and home.
name MOTHBALL MILE
order 1
floor runway
centerline yes
league boneyard
width 58
# x    y    half   features
 240  140   60                     # start line, heading east
 520  120   60     shadow          # under the first row's wings
 800  140   60     crates
 905  270   56
 905  520   56     shadow
 890  740   56     vent:left,period=300,warn=50   # a turbine still spinning
 800  890   58
 560  905   60     sweeper,period=720,speed=40,size=16   # the loose cowling
 330  895   60     crates
 200  800   56
 260  640   54
 500  625   54     shadow
 670  470   54
 510  350   54
 300  380   56     bay:right
 150  330   56
 150  220   58
props tail,engine seg 1 side left gap 70 off 26
props tail,gear seg 4 side right gap 80 off 26
props engine,wingtip seg 8 side both gap 90 off 26
props tail seg 12 side left gap 80 off 26
props gear,tail seg 14 side left gap 80 off 26
